--- !u!114 &443832325
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 443832320}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "Why did you come down here? I mean, why steal the sword from me and Stretch
      if WE\u2019RE the ones with the real answers!"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1364881548}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: "Explain yourself, Thad. And\u2026 Spartan Jack?!\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1364881548}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: "I\u2026 Uh\u2026 Look, I saw Spartan Jack disappear down here just a minute
      ago. I heard him following me. I needed to find him."
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Find him to catch him\u2026 Or are you helping him break into the vault
      and steal the sword? Whose side are you on, Thad?"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 472883133}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Mad
  - text: "Do you really want to betray us for a stupid sword? Or do you want the
      answers you\u2019ve been looking for the whole time? I can tell you the secret,
      Thad. I was about to, before you ran off\u2014\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1364881548}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: "Your mind fills with conflicting messages. The sword is in this very vault,
      right in front of your face. It\u2019s too close to resist\u2026 So what if
      Storm stands in your way? You\u2019ve already taken her on once. And you know
      you have Thad on your side if you do\r\n"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "I side with Spartan Jack. I\u2019m not letting you put your hands on him
      again."
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: '*gasp*'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 472883133}
    pose: Idle
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: "I\u2019M GONNA MAKE YOU PAY, THAD! AND I WILL MAKE SURE YOU WILL NEVER
      BETRAY ME LIKE THIS AGAIN!\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1364881548}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: And you know what, Spartan Jack? You can try all you want to jam your way
      into that Vault, but you will never break through!
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1364881548}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: 'That vault has been sealed forever, Jack. Not even I have seen its contents.
      THE SWORD WAS A LIE, SPARTAN JACK. IT IS ALL A LIE!

'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1364881548}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Mad
  - text: "Even I don\u2019t know the real truth\u2026 But unlike you, I never wished
      to know.\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1364881548}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Dissapointed
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
