--- !u!114 &1053185391
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1053185388}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: 'You, on the other hand.. You have no commitment to anyone. A free agent.

'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1961235555}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: You have been watching your friend Jack slip into the dojo vault and put
      in the code. All it took to break in was remembering the combinations. Good
      thing you have a photographic memory.
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1961235555}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Blank
  - text: "You wave around the geiger counter and listen. A steady ticking sounds,
      unwavering. The walls glow and pulsate\u2013 but it is not radiation. Was it
      all just a lie, to keep each other out of the Vault? Or could it be something
      equally dangerous..."
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1961235555}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Blank
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
--- !u!114 &1053185392
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1053185388}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a22cf3f2be276b74e86b599d61e9adce, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  toBlack: 0
  cameraTarget: {fileID: 1961235555}
--- !u!114 &1053185393
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1053185388}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: 'Your name is BIG SAM. Ever since birth, you have been one thousand percent
      beef. '
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1961235555}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: 
  - text: You have other attributes too, mad ninja skills and a big heart to name
      two, but they seem to have been irrelevant when it came to naming you.
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1961235555}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: 
  - text: "You have used those mad ninja skills to steal a few things on your past
      adventures\u2026 A geiger counter from Torch, a can of weapons-grade body spray
      from Thad, a few lockpicks dropped by unfortunate ninjas"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1961235555}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: 
  - text: "You giggle and trip on your own feet and bump into people so often that
      no one notices, and sometimes you end up with a little something extra in your
      pocket. Everyone says they\u2019re gonna get to the truth, but they\u2019re
      all too jaded to listen"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1961235555}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: 
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
