--- !u!114 &1181644942
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1181644939}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: Stop! Get off me!
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 147867493}
    pose: Defeated
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Mad
  - text: "If you disappear on us before the final fight\u2026 That\u2019s a death
      sentence, Jack"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1524020893}
    pose: Defeated
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Mad
  - text: "Do you hear what Thad is saying right now? He\u2019s unstable - If he
      stays with us in the final battle, he\u2019s gonna backstab us to get in that
      vault, and jeopardize everything in the process, and worst of all he thinks
      he\u2019s doing it for you!"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1524020893}
    pose: Defeated
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Mad
  - text: "If you REALLY wanna keep your friends safe - if you want to stop Jade
      and throw a wrench in Agent R\u2019s schemes, you know the weak links need
      to be dealt with. The sword needs to stay locked away. And Big Sam, who\u2019s
      side are you even on?\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 147867493}
    pose: Defeated
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Mad
  - text: "I\u2019m just the man with the can, man"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Unsheath
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "Ugh. I\u2019m sick of all this wishy-washy side swapping"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 147867493}
    pose: Backflip
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: Jack, make your choice, we settle this now. What party will you take to
      the end?
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
