--- !u!114 &2047961202
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2047961195}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: ...
    name: Agent R
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: SuperheroLanding
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Confused
  - text: "AGENT R?!?! Everyone, it\u2019s a mountain dew! I repeat CODE RED"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Unsheath
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: "M\u2026 Mom?? What are you\u2013"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'SHE''S YOUR.... MOM?!?!? '
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Unsheath
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Now THAT'S my son! C'mere you little warrior! Do you see what\u2019s in
      your hands? THIS is why I brought you here! To fulfill our destiny"
    name: Agent... Mom?
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "I.. I don\u2019t even know what that is anymore\u2026 Who YOU are\u2026\r\n"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Spartan Jack, WE are the true heirs to the sword. We are part of the family!
      Grandmaster had three daughters - One was Jade\u2019s mother, and another was
      ME! I was supposed to have the sword all along - but I was unworthy of its
      strength."
    name: Mom
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Corrupted by its power, I lashed out at my sister, the blade severing her
      spirit from her body, and at that moment I knew I was too impulsive to wield
      Khan
    name: Mom
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "After that incident, I gave the blade to Jade\u2019s family - but if I
      could not be worthy, I would train a son who was! Your father didn\u2019t want
      this life of fighting to catch up to you, so we moved away and hid"
    name: Mom
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: And in secret, I trained you to be the strongest of us all. To be resistant
      to the ninja and their mind games
    name: Mom
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "I was doing it all for you, so you could be great. I invented the prophecy
      so that this town would be ready for you! So the Spartans would help us reclaim
      our family power, and you could infiltrate the dojo girls\u2019 hideout and
      take back the weapon\u2026"
    name: Mom
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Happy
  - text: "But\u2026  But after\u2026 after that one day\u2026"
    name: Mom
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: You got him killed!
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Angry
  - text: "I\u2019m so sorry, Jack\u2026 Everything changed that day. I didn\u2019t
      think I was sending him to his death \u2013 I didn\u2019t think at all. I\u2019ve
      been terrible."
    name: Mom
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Dissappointed
  - text: "I couldn\u2019t stand myself.. But there\u2019s no going back now. I can\u2019t
      have it all be for nothing. In your hand is our ticket to a better life, where
      the rules of society no longer apply."
    name: Mom
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: A world where magic flows free! and we can talk to.. We can rewrite our
      mistakes. We can see Dad again!
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 1143503025}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: (The sword trembles in your hands, but your mother made you strong. You
      steel yourself and stand in front of her)
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Angry
  - text: "You\u2019re right. I have the power to finish this - and not by causing
      some crazy Spartan apocalypse"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "If my whole life was some sick training montage, it worked! I\u2019m strong
      enough in mind, body, and soul to stand up to you, and I am gonna end this
      cycle of violence once and for all!"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Angry
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
