--- !u!114 &2047961209
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2047961195}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c530a24ea0ef8d34990d94afbefe7c3f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - "Your mother\u2019s soul flies straight out of her body, absorbed into the blade.
    It\u2019s like you\u2019re holding her in your hands - and maybe she\u2019s more
    tolerable this way"
  - "You know you can probably visit her, if you\u2019re willing to risk a small
    chance of apocalypse, but it would be better if the sword was sealed away in
    the Vault"
  - "You feel a little slimy - a little Jade-like. A little bit like your mom. But
    it\u2019s how you were raised - How Spartans are made. And if anyone is fit to
    protect the blade, it\u2019s you"
