--- !u!114 &2139203365
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2139203363}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: This is it, Spartan Jack. Finally we have the power to uncover the secret
      the ninjas have tried so hard to hide from us. Jack, do you have the homemade
      explosives?
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Yes sir! Primed and ready to detonate!
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: Sam, do you have the can of Axe Body S- I mean Tactical Smoke And Odor
      Screen?
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Affirmative
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Where\u2019s Torch?"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "Umm, I haven\u2019t heard from him all night. Maybe he chickened out?
      Let\u2019s hope he\u2019s not with Storm and Stretch"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Oh well, the plan must go on\u2026 Be silent now. We might think we\u2019re
      the only ones here, but if there\u2019s one thing I know about the ninjas,
      it's that they\u2019re masters at sneaking up on you\u2026"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Are you sure we want to do this, Thad? We might be walking right into a
      radioactive death trap
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Yeah, yeah, and you\u2019re gonna cause the end of the world. I\u2019ve
      heard it all, and do you know how much I believe?"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Umm.. What would the ninjas be doing with a radioactive sword anyway?
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Umm, protecting it? From people like Jade and Chrome Dome.. And.. Us?
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Are you going back on me now? In our moment of glory?
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Storm called me about the whole radioactive thing... She sounded urgent,
      so it might be true. At least - I know for a fact that she believes it. They
      might hate our guts, but I know the girls care about us, Thad.
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "And you heard that walkie talkie we stole.. Agent R, whoever she is, WANTS
      me to open the vault. She organized this whole thing, because she thinks she
      has me figured out. And we have no idea how strong she is - Now you\u2019re
      asking me to play into her hand?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "This town is filled with so many jerks. But these particular jerks are
      doing half the work for us - hear me out\u2026"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "We stick to the shadows and disappear. Without our help, the ninjas will
      be no match for Jade. She will put those self-righteous pieces of trash in
      their place, and they\u2019ll weaken Jade in the process. Once she opens the
      vault: BOOM! We strike. And then we are the only ones left\r\n"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "But what if we\u2019re not\u2026 strong enough?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Then we die like men
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Prepare for war, my dude. The dojo girls are coming at midnight. What time
      is it now?
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Umm.. 12:03
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "\u2026"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Idle
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: I hear footsteps! Quick, Jack Hide!
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
